@OrderManagement.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5000

### Login
POST {{OrderManagement.Api_HostAddress}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "dev@martech.com",
  "password": "Senha@123"
}

### Create order - replace TOKEN and use a valid CustomerId
POST {{OrderManagement.Api_HostAddress}}/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
  "items": [
    {
      "productName": "Keyboard",
      "quantity": 2,
      "unitPrice": 100.00
    }
  ]
}

### List orders
GET {{OrderManagement.Api_HostAddress}}/api/orders?page=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN

### Get order
GET {{OrderManagement.Api_HostAddress}}/api/orders/ORDER_ID
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN

### Cancel order
PATCH {{OrderManagement.Api_HostAddress}}/api/orders/ORDER_ID/cancel
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN
